sequenceDiagram
    participant Konflux as Konflux Build System
    participant Registry as Container Registry<br/>registry.redhat.io<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Operator as ODH/RHOAI Operator
    participant Dashboard as ODH Dashboard
    participant User as User Browser
    participant Ingress as Platform Ingress<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.3
    participant RBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS mTLS
    participant Jupyter as JupyterLab<br/>8888/TCP HTTP
    participant DSPA as Data Science Pipelines<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Culler as Notebook Controller Culler
    participant Nginx as nginx Proxy<br/>80/TCP HTTP
    participant HTTPD as httpd CGI<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant CodeSrv as code-server<br/>8585/TCP HTTP

    Note over Konflux,Registry: Flow 1: Workbench Image Deployment

    Konflux->>Registry: Push built image<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Registry credentials
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Watch for ImageStream changes<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+<br/>ServiceAccount token
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Apply kustomize manifests<br/>(ImageStream creation)<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
    Dashboard->>K8sAPI: Discover ImageStreams<br/>(opendatahub.io/notebook-image label)<br/>HTTPS/6443 User OAuth
    User->>Dashboard: Select workbench image<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.3 OAuth
    Dashboard->>K8sAPI: Create Notebook CR<br/>HTTPS/6443 User OAuth
    Note over K8sAPI: Notebook Controller<br/>mutating webhook injects:<br/>- kube-rbac-proxy sidecar<br/>- CA cert mount<br/>- pipeline runtime ConfigMap<br/>- DSPA connection secret

    Note over User,DSPA: Flow 2: JupyterLab User Session

    User->>Ingress: Access notebook UI<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.3 OAuth
    Ingress->>RBAC: Forward to sidecar<br/>HTTPS/8443 mTLS<br/>ServiceAccount token
    RBAC->>Jupyter: Proxy to JupyterLab<br/>HTTP/8888 (pod-local)<br/>Proxied auth
    Jupyter->>DSPA: Submit pipeline (Elyra)<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Bearer Token
    DSPA-->>Jupyter: Pipeline run status

    Note over Culler,CodeSrv: Flow 3: Code-Server Activity Tracking (Idle Culling)

    Culler->>RBAC: Poll /api/kernels/<br/>HTTPS/8443 mTLS<br/>ServiceAccount token
    RBAC->>Nginx: Proxy request<br/>HTTP/80 (pod-local)
    Nginx->>HTTPD: Forward to CGI<br/>HTTP/8080 (pod-local)
    HTTPD->>CodeSrv: Check healthz<br/>HTTP/8585 (pod-local)
    CodeSrv-->>HTTPD: Health status
    HTTPD-->>Nginx: Jupyter-compatible JSON<br/>(fake kernels response)
    Nginx-->>RBAC: Activity response
    RBAC-->>Culler: Last activity timestamp
